# User Flow

## Owner Generates Invite Code

```text
Settings → Household Members

↓

Tap "Generate Invite Code"

↓

Code displayed (e.g., "KIN-A1B2C3")

↓

Tap "Copy" or "Share"

↓

Code copied to clipboard / shared via native share sheet
```

---

## Member Joins Household

```text
App Open (new user or user without Household)

↓

Onboarding Screen

↓

Tap "Join with Invite Code"

↓

Enter code

↓

Tap "Join Household"

↓

Member added to Household

↓

Navigate to Home (shared Household)
```

---

## Owner Removes Member

```text
Settings → Household Members

↓

Swipe left on Member → Tap "Remove"

↓

Confirmation dialog

↓

Tap "Remove"

↓

Member removed from Household

↓

Member loses access to Household data
```

