# Business Rules

## Household

- A Household must always have at least one Owner.
- A Household can have multiple Members.
- In MVP, a user can only belong to one Household.

---

## Invite Code

- An invite code is unique and generated per Household.
- An invite code expires after 7 days (or never — TBD during implementation).
- An invite code can only be used once (or multiple times — TBD during implementation).
- Only the Owner can generate an invite code.

---

## Owner

- The user who creates the Household is automatically the Owner.
- Owner has full control over Accounts, Categories, and Members.
- Owner cannot leave the Household (must transfer ownership first — future).

---

## Member

- Member can view, create, edit, and delete Transactions and Budgets.
- Member cannot create, edit, delete Accounts or Categories.
- Member cannot invite or remove other Members.
- Member can leave the Household voluntarily (future).

---

## Permission

| Action | Owner | Member |
| ------------------ | :---: | :----: |
| View Household |  ✅   |   ✅   |
| Rename Household |  ✅   |   ❌   |
| Generate Invite Code |  ✅   |   ❌   |
| Join Household |  ✅   |   ✅   |
| View Members |  ✅   |   ✅   |
| Remove Member |  ✅   |   ❌   |
| Leave Household |  ❌ (future)   |   ✅ (future)   |

